[en.DECISION_C01_A_PRIVATE_LETTER]
A Private Letter

[en.DECISION_C01_A_PRIVATE_LETTER_desc]
Cozy Glow writes a letter to her mom, who has been deliberatedly kept out side of public attention, the only pony that Cozy Glow can truly trusts and can confide in.

[en.DECISION_C01_A_PRIVATE_LETTER_NON_AVAILABLE_TOOLTIP]
Cozy Glow’s mom hasn’t been replying for quite a long time...

[zh.DECISION_C01_A_PRIVATE_LETTER]
一封私密书信

[zh.DECISION_C01_A_PRIVATE_LETTER_desc]
和煦光流写一封信给她的母亲，她的母亲一直被故意地隔离在公众视线之外，是和煦光流唯一可以真正信任并且可以倾诉的对象。

[zh.DECISION_C01_A_PRIVATE_LETTER_NON_AVAILABLE_TOOLTIP]
和煦光流的母亲已经很久没有回信了...
